values ($lx$tak-sun-comparion-insurance-chandler$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$legal-finance$lx$), $lx$Tak Sun, Comparion Insurance Agency$lx$, $lx$孫維特$lx$, $lx$Taiwan-born insurance agent in Chandler comparing car, home, life and pet coverage from 15+ carriers; speaks Mandarin and Taiwanese.$lx$, $lx$在台灣出生的錢德勒保險代理人，比較超過 15 家保險公司的汽車、房屋、人壽及寵物保險，可說國語及台語。$lx$, $lx$Tak Sun (孫維特) is a licensed insurance agent with Comparion Insurance Agency at 180 S Arizona Ave, Suite 102, in Chandler. He has worked as an insurance agent in Arizona for more than two decades and can quote options from more than 15 insurance carriers, covering car, home, umbrella, life and pet insurance. Born in Taiwan, he speaks Mandarin and Taiwanese as well as English, and his agent page includes a Chinese-language introduction. He is also licensed in California, Montana, New Mexico and Nevada.$lx$, $lx$孫維特（Tak Sun）是 Comparion Insurance Agency 的持照保險代理人，辦公室位於錢德勒 180 S Arizona Ave, Suite 102。他在亞利桑那從事保險代理已超過二十年，可比較超過 15 家保險公司的方案，涵蓋汽車、房屋、傘式責任、人壽及寵物保險。他在台灣出生，能以國語、台語及英語服務，代理人頁面也有中文自我介紹。他另持有加州、蒙大拿州、新墨西哥州及內華達州的保險執照。$lx$, $lx$Chandler$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$180 S Arizona Ave, Suite 102, Chandler, AZ 85225$lx$, null, $lx$(480) 209-6015$lx$, $lx$whittak.sun@comparioninsurance.com$lx$, $lx$https://www.comparioninsurance.com/insurance-agent/arizona/chandler-0614/tak$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$Taiwanese$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Tak Sun, Comparion Insurance Agency$lx$, $lx$孫維特$lx$, $lx$Chandler$lx$, $lx$legal-finance$lx$, $lx$comparioninsurance.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$Taiwanese$lx$, $lx$insurance agent$lx$, $lx$保險$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

