values ($lx$jill-yen-roi-properties-phoenix$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$real-estate$lx$), $lx$Jill Yen, R.O.I. Properties$lx$, $lx$閻正倫$lx$, $lx$Mandarin-speaking commercial and residential agent at R.O.I. Properties in Phoenix, with a background in business law.$lx$, $lx$鳳凰城 R.O.I. Properties 會說國語的商業及住宅房地產經紀人，具商業法律背景。$lx$, $lx$Jill Yen (閻正倫) is a licensed real estate agent and Senior Vice President in the commercial division of R.O.I. Properties, a Phoenix brokerage at 3333 E Camelback Rd. She represents companies, investors and business owners in commercial and residential deals across Greater Phoenix, including leasing and buying land, office, retail, industrial and residential property. Before real estate she practiced law; she holds a law degree from the University of Washington and a Master of Real Estate Development from ASU. She is fluent in Mandarin, her clients have included Topco Scientific, Scientech and CT-Tech, and she serves on the board of the Taiwanese American Chamber of Commerce of Greater Phoenix.$lx$, $lx$閻正倫（Jill Yen）是亞利桑那持照房地產經紀人，現任鳳凰城房地產公司 R.O.I. Properties 商業部資深副總裁，公司位於 3333 E Camelback Rd。她為企業、投資人及企業主處理大鳳凰城地區的商業與住宅交易，包括土地、辦公室、零售、工業及住宅物業的租賃與買賣。她從事房地產前曾執業律師，擁有華盛頓大學法學學位及亞利桑那州立大學（ASU）房地產開發碩士學位。她能流利使用國語，服務過的客戶包括 Topco Scientific、Scientech、CT-Tech 等公司，並擔任大鳳凰城台美商會（Taiwanese American Chamber of Commerce of Greater Phoenix）理事。$lx$, $lx$Phoenix$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$3333 E Camelback Rd, Suite 252, Phoenix, AZ 85018$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$(425) 269-9264$lx$, null, $lx$https://roiproperties.com/team-members/jill-yen/$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Jill Yen, R.O.I. Properties$lx$, $lx$閻正倫$lx$, $lx$Phoenix$lx$, $lx$real-estate$lx$, $lx$roiproperties.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$realtor real estate agent$lx$, $lx$房地產經紀人 買房$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text[], true, true, false, false, false, $lx$live$lx$, $lx$editor_verified$lx$, now())
on conflict (slug) do nothing;

